TASK-197 runtime harness (b): the dev-mode hazard border shows only on the
window's SELECTED row, like Arc (unselected dev rows keep the host line).
Temporary code, never committed to Detour/. Apply, build, run, revert:

    git apply docs/harness/task197b-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    # Retina on a 1x monitor: the TASK-110 virtual display (docs/task-110/vdisplay.m),
    #   ./vdisplay &  (a 2x screen until killed); the harness moves window 1
    #   (760x640) onto the first 2x screen and window 2 beside it.
    # $SITE: app.html "Dev App", api.html "API Server", split.html "Split Local",
    #   pin.html "Pinned Dev", dormant.html "Dormant Pin", fav.html "Fav Dev",
    #   other.html "Other Space Dev" (a <title>, an <h1>, color-scheme light dark).
    python3 -m http.server 8897 --bind 127.0.0.1 --directory "$SITE" &
    DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify197b DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR="$OUT" DETOUR_VERIFY_PORT=8897 \
        .derived/Build/Products/Debug/Detour.app/Contents/MacOS/Detour &
    # a watcher runs `screencapture -x -o -l <windowNumber> $OUT/<name>.png`
    # for each "SHOOT <name> <windowNumber>" line of $OUT/verify.log (checking
    # the screen is unlocked first); the harness waits for each PNG. Wait for
    # "done" (about 60 s), then kill that pid, the server and vdisplay.
    git apply -R docs/harness/task197b-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    rm -r -- ~/Library/Application\ Support/DetourVerify197b

Setup: normal rows Split Local (localhost) | Reference (data:), Remote Docs
(data:), API Server (127.0.0.1), Dev App (localhost); pinned Pinned Dev
(live, localhost) and Dormant Pin (dormant, localhost); favourite Fav Dev
(localhost). Each SHOOT logs every visible row (row view isSelected, the
cell's isRowSelected, host line text, border sides, title and host-line
frames) and every favourite tile (isSelected, border).

Steps, in light (L-) then dark (D-):
  1  selectTab(Dev App)
  2  API Server via the table's selectRowIndexes (the click path)
  3  selectTab(Remote Docs)
  4a selectTab(Reference), the split's NON-dev pane focused
  4b selectTab(Split Local), the dev pane focused
  4c selectTab(Dev App): the split unselected
  5a selectTab(Fav Dev's tab)
  5b selectTab(Pinned Dev): the favourite unselected
Then, light: 7a a second space with Other Space Dev selected, 7b back to the
first space; 6 a second window on the same space selecting API Server while
window 1 keeps Dev App (light and dark); 8 window 1 closes its selected tab
(closeCurrentTab).

Results (2026-10-24, macOS 26.7, 2x virtual display, captures 1520x1280 px;
screen unlocked for every capture; all 25 read, each matching the log):
  1  Dev App bordered; API Server, Pinned Dev, Dormant Pin: host line only
