#FF7600 alternating with #191919 dashes (light) / #0D0D0D (dark): the brand
orange of DevModePalette.standard.
Not exercised: Ctrl+Tab and keyboard navigation as such (both end in
selectTab, the path steps 1, 3-5 drive).

